Port Go net/http + gorilla/mux to Ipe.Http.Server.

Upstream Sky used `Net.Http` + `Github.Com.Gorilla.Mux` (Go FFI). Replace
with `Ipe.Http.Server` which provides behaviour-equivalent typed route
dispatch: Server.get/post match path patterns, each handler receives a typed
Request and returns `Task Error Response`. The three routes (/, /echo, /ping)
and their response bodies are preserved verbatim.

